WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.669
-Two of Rudy Giuliani's
associates

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:04.904
were arrested last night

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.772
as support for impeachment
rises in the polls.

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:08.908
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.410
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.912 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.048
Over the last few weeks,
we've seen support

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.516
for impeaching President Trump
skyrocket by double digits,

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:18.718
and it really feels like

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.319
a potentially seismic
political shift

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:21.254
is happening right now.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.755
In fact, even Fox News,

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:24.924
the network Trump
loves the most,

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.359
released a damning new poll
yesterday showing that

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:30.863
a majority of registered voters
not only want Trump impeached,

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.132
they want him removed
from office completely.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.000
-A new Fox poll just out

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.436
shows more than half
of registered voters

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:40.206
who were asked
support impeachment.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.808
-Our brand-new Fox News poll,
the headline,

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:44.477
more than half of those polled,

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.013
51%, want President Trump
impeached

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.648
and removed from office.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.350
-Damn, that's a Fox News poll.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.354
So you know they only called
land lines, CB radios,

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.356
and VFW halls.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.356 --> 00:01:00.026
Fox news -- Fox News
is what Trump watches

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.294
to feel good about himself.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.396
That's like if a kid
turned on "Sesame Street"

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:06.399
and Big Bird was just
smoking a cigarette going,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.567
[ Gruff voice ] "Face it, kid,

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.601
you're never going to learn
how to spell."

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.771
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:15.074
Now, of course,

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.643
to make himself feel better,
Trump likes to periodically

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.146
hold a campaign rally
with his remaining fans

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.882
where he reels off
a bunch of unhinged nonsense.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.184
And that's what he did tonight

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:26.151
after we taped this show
in Minneapolis,

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:28.822
or at least they think
he went to Minneapolis.

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:31.657
Yesterday, he had some trouble
saying the name of the city.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:35.895
-I want to also thank the
Minionapolis police department.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.997
-That's right, he's going to
Minionapolis,

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:41.768
which I believe is in Mindiana.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.869
He sounds like Siri
giving you directions

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:46.439
after having a few too many
glasses of wine with dinner.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.108
-You have arrived in
Minnemanapolis.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.109
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:52.311
-But when he's not basking...

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:53.746
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.581
When he's not basking
in the adoration

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:58.217
of his most fawning admirers
at his unhinged rallies,

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:00.920
Trump is apparently freaking out
about losing support

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.254
among Republicans in Congress.

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:05.124
In fact, he's so worried
about Republicans in the Senate

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.493
turning on him that he's been
calling Senate Majority Leader

00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:10.963
Mitch McConnell nonstop
to lock down Republican support.

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:13.466
-New indications suggest how
seriously President Trump

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.502
is now taking the impeachment
inquiry

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:18.204
and how seriously he's pushing
to keep Republican Senators,

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:20.506
potential jurors, remember,
in line.

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.975
-One of the things we've learned
is that the president

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:25.678
is so consumed with
this impeachment inquiry

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.813
that he's now calling
Senator McConnell

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:29.915
as many as three times a day.

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:31.617
-Three times a day?

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:33.919
He's trying to keep McConnell
in line, or stalk him?

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:35.154
[ As Trump ] "Mitch!

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:37.657
Mitch, we're best friends,
Mitch, aren't we, Mitch?

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.759
Mitch. Do you like my new
haircut, Mitch?

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:42.861
I'm just like you, Mitch.
I'm just like you."

00:02:42.861 --> 00:02:44.130
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.064
[ Normal voice ]
Trump, of course...

00:02:46.064 --> 00:02:47.934
Trump, of course, is freaking
out because every day,

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.035
we learn more about the scheme
Trump and his gang

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:53.806
of Mafia-themed Pez dispensers
concocted to get Ukraine

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.074
to dig up dirt on Joe Biden.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.376
Now Trump has been insisting
that his phone call

00:02:57.376 --> 00:02:59.512
with Ukraine's President
in which he dangled

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.413
hundreds of millions of dollars
in military aid,

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:03.683
and in return told the president
of Ukraine,

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.518
"I would like you to do us a
favor, though,"

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.687
was not just appropriate,
but perfect.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.388
He's literally said or tweeted

00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:12.158
that specific word
dozens of times.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:15.494
-The conversation I had with
the president of Ukraine

00:03:15.494 --> 00:03:17.730
was absolutely perfect.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.000
The conversation, by the way,
was absolutely perfect.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.135
It was a perfect conversation.

00:03:23.135 --> 00:03:24.303
It was perfect.

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:25.505
The call was perfect.

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:27.273
That was a perfect conversation.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.041
Just so you know,
the call was perfect.

00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:30.109
It was perfect.

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.210
It was perfect.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.712
The call was a perfect call.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.014
It was a perfect call.
Perfect call.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:38.884
Had a perfect phone call with
the president of Ukraine --

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:40.687
like, I mean, perfect.

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.088
The call was a perfect call.

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:44.790
The conversation was, I think,
a perfect conversation.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.292
That call was perfect.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:49.128
-I think he's trying to drive us
all insane.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:53.299
Hearing -- hearing a grown man
describe a phone call as perfect

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.134
over and over and over again

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:57.003
feels like an elaborate form
of torture.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.839
I feel like I should be strapped
to a chair in a basement

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:01.641
with voices whispering
from the shadows.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.742
-[ Whispering ]
The call was perfect.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.709
-[ Whispering ]
It was a perfect call.

00:04:03.709 --> 00:04:04.810
-[ Whispering ] It was perfect.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.044
-[ Whispering ]
It was a perfect call.

00:04:06.044 --> 00:04:07.146
-[ Whispering ]
The conversation was perfect.

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.347
-[ Whispering ]
It was perfect call.

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:11.083
-All right! I'll tell you
what you want to know!

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:13.319
Just stop calling a phone call
perfect.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.187
Nobody says that.

00:04:15.187 --> 00:04:17.623
Seriously, I'm almost certain
that no one in the history

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:19.792
of the English language
has ever called a phone call

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:21.227
perfect before.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:23.329
Think of the greatest phone call
you've ever had in your life.

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.231
You've never hung up the phone
and gone,

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:29.669
"Damn! That was perfect!

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:30.703
Whoo! Whoo!"

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:33.006
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:35.908
I mean...

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:38.510
I rescheduled that dentist
appointment

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.545
like a mother[bleep]!

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:41.013
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:43.683
I mean, he's talking about a
phone call like it was an event

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:44.917
at the Olympics.

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.452
[ As Trump ]
Okay. Talk to you soon.

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:50.556
Judges?

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.258
Yes!

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:54.093
[ Normal voice ] So Trump has
insisted the call was perfect,

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.394
and yet once again yesterday,

00:04:55.394 --> 00:04:58.364
Fox News' poll showed that
the vast majority

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:01.467
of registered voters definitely
do not think it was perfect.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:04.303
&gt;&gt; The Fox News poll also gauged
voters' reaction

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:06.472
to what President Trump said
on his phone call

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:09.742
with his Ukrainian counterpart
regarding possible pressure

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:12.411
put on Ukraine to investigate
the Bidens.

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:15.214
43% say it's an impeachable
offense.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:17.817
-If Trump can't rely on Fox News
to make himself feel better,

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.285
what can he watch?

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:21.421
His aides are going to have
to replace his TV with a mirror

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.523
and hope he doesn't notice.

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:24.957
[ As Trump ]
Have you guys seen this show?

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.025
It's pretty good.

00:05:27.025 --> 00:05:32.331
Wait, what were you looking at?

00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:34.767
Get in here, guys!

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.969
[ Normal voice ] So now that
Trump is freaking out

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:39.639
about the growing support
for impeachment in the polls,

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.873
he's throwing as many people
as he can under the bus.

00:05:41.873 --> 00:05:44.410
Last week, for example,
Trump tried to pin the blame

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.547
for the Ukraine phone call on
his Energy Secretary Rick Perry,

00:05:47.547 --> 00:05:48.748
claiming it was Perry's idea

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:49.882
to make the call
in the first place.

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:51.784
But then we found out yesterday

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:54.519
that Trump order Perry and two
State Department officials

00:05:54.519 --> 00:05:56.989
to coordinate with his personal
attorney, Rudy Giuliani,

00:05:56.989 --> 00:05:59.124
as part of the scheme
to extort Ukraine

00:05:59.124 --> 00:06:00.259
and get them to gin up

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:01.994
politically motivated
investigations.

00:06:01.994 --> 00:06:04.263
-Two sources tell CNN that
President Trump

00:06:04.263 --> 00:06:07.166
directed his Energy Secretary
Rick Perry

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:09.234
and two top State Department
officials

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:11.403
to circumvent official channels

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:13.973
and to have his personal
attorney, Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:16.442
deal with a potential meeting
with the Ukrainian President.

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:18.377
-So Trump concocted a scheme
to dangle

00:06:18.377 --> 00:06:20.980
hundreds of millions of dollars
in military aid to Ukraine

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.449
as part of a quid pro quo
to get them to dig up dirt

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:26.151
on a political opponent,
and to carry out this plan,

00:06:26.151 --> 00:06:29.588
he chose as his henchman
Rick Perry and Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:29.588 --> 00:06:33.292
who are famously two of
the dumbest people in politics.

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:36.428
It's like if Lex Luthor
hatched a plan to kill Superman

00:06:36.428 --> 00:06:37.997
and chose as his assassins

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:40.732
Mr. Bean and Woody
from "Cheers."

00:06:40.732 --> 00:06:43.902
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:43.902 --> 00:06:45.771
[ As Woody ] You ready to do
this?

00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:48.975
All right. I'll take the front.
You take the back, Bean.

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:51.543
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.543 --> 00:06:53.613
[ Normal voice ] And then today,
things got much, much worse

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:55.381
for Rudy when
two of his associates

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:57.316
who'd been working with him
as part of the scheme

00:06:57.316 --> 00:06:59.451
to dig up dirt on Biden
were arrested

00:06:59.451 --> 00:07:02.188
and charged with breaking
campaign finance laws.

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:04.056
-We begin with breaking news
this hour.

00:07:04.056 --> 00:07:07.326
Two associates of Rudy Giuliani
arrested this morning

00:07:07.326 --> 00:07:09.895
due in court in Virginia
later today

00:07:09.895 --> 00:07:13.766
facing criminal charges for
violating campaign finance laws.

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:16.035
And, really, it all has to do
with Ukraine.

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:19.338
-Their names are Igor Fruman
and Lev Parnas.

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:22.607
And they were arrested
at a Washington airport

00:07:22.607 --> 00:07:24.409
with what prosecutors say

00:07:24.409 --> 00:07:26.779
were one-way tickets
out of the country.

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:30.315
-Rudy Giuliani has previously
stated that he has worked with

00:07:30.315 --> 00:07:33.819
the two men on efforts
to get Ukraine to investigate

00:07:33.819 --> 00:07:35.354
former Vice President Joe Biden.

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:37.289
-I can't believe a guy
who looks like a vampire

00:07:37.289 --> 00:07:38.924
had a henchman named Igor.

00:07:38.924 --> 00:07:41.661
Is this a Mary Shelley novel?

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:44.330
What was Igor's job,
to open Rudy's coffin?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.498
Master, arise!

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:51.403
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:51.403 --> 00:07:53.439
Now, the danger for Rudy
and for Trump

00:07:53.439 --> 00:07:55.007
is that these guys
might flip on them

00:07:55.007 --> 00:07:57.276
and give prosecutors more
evidence about their scheme.

00:07:57.276 --> 00:07:59.411
And now that two
of his closest associates

00:07:59.411 --> 00:08:01.013
have been arrested
and charged with crimes,

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:03.882
Rudy might be regretting
the fact he's been all over TV

00:08:03.882 --> 00:08:05.884
blabbing about his involvement
in all of this.

00:08:05.884 --> 00:08:07.953
In fact, here are some
of Rudy's greatest

00:08:07.953 --> 00:08:11.090
and most nonsensical highlights
from just the last few weeks.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.792
-Did you read the transcript?

00:08:12.792 --> 00:08:14.293
-Uh, let's say
it was read to me.

00:08:14.293 --> 00:08:16.429
-It was read to you, the whole
thing?

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:17.863
-Uh, I hope.

00:08:17.863 --> 00:08:20.632
Shut up, moron. Shut up.
-Okay. Hold on. Hold on.

00:08:20.632 --> 00:08:22.234
-Shut up. You don't know
what you're talking about.

00:08:22.234 --> 00:08:25.104
Bill Clinton asked me,
what's this guy, Romney, like?

00:08:25.104 --> 00:08:29.008
You know what I told him?
He's our Al Gore.

00:08:29.008 --> 00:08:30.710
-All right, Rudy,
hold that thought.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:33.012
-Here's Kurt saying, "Great,
I will tell Yermak,

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:34.813
and he'll visit with you there,
thanks."

00:08:34.813 --> 00:08:36.348
-Arms, border crews.
Arms, border crews. Whoo-whoo.

00:08:36.348 --> 00:08:39.051
-By the way, Biden's been off
the trail.

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:41.119
-They're supported
by three affidavits.

00:08:41.119 --> 00:08:44.156
The guy was under investigation.
The guy bankrupted a --

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:46.625
He's been selling --
How about this?

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:48.527
-No, no, I don't want to move on
yet.

00:08:48.527 --> 00:08:49.829
-Here's another one.

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:51.831
"I don't know about it.
I didn't hear it."

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:52.898
-We got the whistle-blower,

00:08:52.898 --> 00:08:54.132
we have the transcript
of the call,

00:08:54.132 --> 00:08:55.701
and the president's remarks.
-Shhhhhhhhh! Shhh!

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:58.503
I want you to keep your eye
on Romania.

00:08:58.503 --> 00:09:01.540
Just watch Romania.
Just watch Romania.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.210
We go to China,
I told you about Romania.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.946
We haven't moved to Romania yet.
When should we get to Romania?

00:09:07.946 --> 00:09:11.083
-Well, I definitely can't wait
until you get to Romania.

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:12.151
[ Laughter ]

00:09:12.151 --> 00:09:13.886
There's probably
a short trip from there

00:09:13.886 --> 00:09:15.821
back to where you live
in Transylvania.

00:09:15.821 --> 00:09:16.655
[ Applause ]

00:09:16.655 --> 00:09:19.625
Also, by the way, remember --

00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:21.760
remember those papers
Rudy was holding up

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:24.096
in that one clip claiming
that they were affidavits

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:25.264
that proved his allegations?

00:09:25.264 --> 00:09:27.033
Well, according to BuzzFeed,
they weren't.

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:28.467
They were pages printed from

00:09:28.467 --> 00:09:30.903
an obscure right-wing conspiracy
theory website.

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:32.505
So the president's personal
lawyer,

00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:34.607
a man who is at the center
of an impeachment inquiry

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:36.575
and an allegedly criminal scheme

00:09:36.575 --> 00:09:38.811
to extort a foreign country
to dig up dirt

00:09:38.811 --> 00:09:41.246
on a political opponent
is an insane old man

00:09:41.246 --> 00:09:43.348
who goes on TV
and waves around printouts

00:09:43.348 --> 00:09:44.750
from conspiracy websites.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.853
Next time he's just going to
bring the printer test page.

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:49.187
[ As Giuliani ]
Now, t-the yellow line

00:09:49.187 --> 00:09:51.690
is Ukrainian military,
and then the red line is money

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.626
that Hunter Biden made.
It's all right here!

00:09:53.626 --> 00:09:55.361
[ Grumbles ]

00:09:55.361 --> 00:09:56.962
[ Laughter ]

00:09:56.962 --> 00:10:00.532
-And while Republicans
entertain...

00:10:00.532 --> 00:10:02.534
While Republicans entertain
these insane fantasies,

00:10:02.534 --> 00:10:04.103
the whistle-blower
who first alerted us

00:10:04.103 --> 00:10:05.638
to Trump's phone calls
keeps coming forward

00:10:05.638 --> 00:10:09.008
with more actual evidence, as we
found out yet again yesterday.

00:10:09.008 --> 00:10:11.676
-CBS News has learned
that according to a memo

00:10:11.676 --> 00:10:12.978
by the whistle-blower,

00:10:12.978 --> 00:10:15.280
a White House official
who listened in on the call

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:18.784
to Ukraine's President described
the call as crazy,

00:10:18.784 --> 00:10:21.520
frightening, and completely
lacking in substance

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.355
related to national security.

00:10:23.355 --> 00:10:26.826
-The official was visibly shaken
by what had transpired.

00:10:26.826 --> 00:10:28.393
And in the official's view,

00:10:28.393 --> 00:10:31.397
the president had clearly
committed a criminal act.

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:33.131
-Wow, that is damning.
When he heard that,

00:10:33.131 --> 00:10:34.899
Trump immediately
ran out of the white house

00:10:34.899 --> 00:10:36.068
and tried to escape to...

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:37.202
-Minionapolis.

00:10:37.202 --> 00:10:40.572
-Now, seeing more evidence
is emerging

00:10:40.572 --> 00:10:42.540
that support for impeachment
is rising in the polls,

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.410
Trump is trying to take
as many people down with him

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.046
while his inner circle
tries to do everything they can

00:10:47.046 --> 00:10:48.647
to distance themselves
from the scandal.

00:10:48.647 --> 00:10:50.615
For example, you might remember

00:10:50.615 --> 00:10:52.751
that Trump dragged
Vice President Mike Pence

00:10:52.751 --> 00:10:54.787
into his mess when he told
reporters to look at

00:10:54.787 --> 00:10:57.222
Pence's conversations with
the President of Ukraine.

00:10:57.222 --> 00:10:58.758
And then
"The Washington Post" reported

00:10:58.758 --> 00:11:00.626
that Trump involved Pence
in his efforts

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:02.228
to pressure Ukraine's leader.

00:11:02.228 --> 00:11:04.730
So yesterday,
reporters asked Pence

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.665
how much he knew about
the scheme,

00:11:06.665 --> 00:11:09.101
and Pence wouldn't give
a straight answer.

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:10.836
-Were you ever aware,
Mr. Vice President,

00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:12.404
of the interest in the Bidens,

00:11:12.404 --> 00:11:14.406
the interest in investigating
the Bidens was at least,

00:11:14.406 --> 00:11:18.010
in part, of the reason for aid
to Ukraine-based help?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:22.213
-I -- What -- I never
discussed the issue

00:11:22.213 --> 00:11:24.549
of -- of -- the issue

00:11:24.549 --> 00:11:25.951
of the Bidens with President
Zelensky, and...

00:11:25.951 --> 00:11:27.386
-But with the administration?

00:11:27.386 --> 00:11:29.155
Were you ever aware of it
in the administration?

00:11:29.155 --> 00:11:32.791
-What I can tell you is that all
of our discussions is internal

00:11:32.791 --> 00:11:34.126
and corruption.
-But you are aware

00:11:34.126 --> 00:11:35.861
of the interest in the Bidens
being investigated

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:38.797
and that being tied to aid
to Ukraine being held up.

00:11:38.797 --> 00:11:41.733
-Well -- Well, that's your
question.

00:11:41.733 --> 00:11:44.736
Let me be very clear.

00:11:44.736 --> 00:11:47.506
The issue of aid...

00:11:47.506 --> 00:11:52.845
and -- and -- and our efforts
with regard to Ukraine, uh,

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:57.916
were from -- from my experience,
uh, in no way connected.

00:11:57.916 --> 00:12:01.020
-[ As Pence ]
Oh, oh, what you...

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.688
um...

00:12:03.688 --> 00:12:08.627
What you need to know from me
about this

00:12:08.627 --> 00:12:11.096
is I don't want to go to jail.

00:12:11.096 --> 00:12:14.466
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:12:14.466 --> 00:12:18.437
[ Normal voice ]
Hey. Hey, Mike Pence.

00:12:18.437 --> 00:12:19.772
I can't believe I'm saying this,

00:12:19.772 --> 00:12:22.941
but maybe you should let
Rudy handle this one.

00:12:22.941 --> 00:12:26.612
I mean, he's probably working on
his Pence impression right now.

00:12:26.612 --> 00:12:28.113
[ Laughter ]

00:12:28.113 --> 00:12:30.048
In fact, given that two people
have now been arrested

00:12:30.048 --> 00:12:32.117
and the support for impeachment
is rising the polls,

00:12:32.117 --> 00:12:35.487
my legal advice for all of these
guys would be very simple.

00:12:35.487 --> 00:12:37.789
-Shut up, moron. Shut up.

00:12:37.789 --> 00:12:39.291
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:39.291 --> 00:12:40.759
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:40.759 --> 00:12:42.928 line:0%
♪♪

